sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant FE as Frontend
  participant API as Paper API (Gin)
  participant DB as TimescaleDB
  participant PE as PaperEngine
  participant JS as JetStream

  FE->>API: POST /api/v1/paper/orders (JWT)
  API->>DB: INSERT paper_orders RETURNING id
  API-->>FE: 200 OK (order created)

  PE->>JS: Subscribe market.kline.1m.*
  JS-->>PE: Kline msg
  PE->>PE: Update market snapshot
  PE->>PE: Match open orders (in-memory)
  PE->>DB: BEGIN
  PE->>DB: UPDATE paper_orders (fills/status)
  PE->>DB: UPDATE paper_accounts (balance)
  PE->>DB: UPSERT paper_positions
  PE->>DB: COMMIT
